---
---

<section class="section about-section" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="section-tag">01 // About Me</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Engineering Scalable ERP Systems from Business Logic</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Bridging the gap between real-world operational challenges and clean, maintainable software architecture.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-grid">
      <!-- Main Narrative Column -->
      <div class="about-text-col reveal">
        <p class="lead-text">
          I am a <strong>Python and Odoo Developer</strong> at <em>Prosevo Technologies</em>, delivering custom modules for live, multi-branch ERP implementations.
        </p>

        <p>
          My background in <strong>Artificial Intelligence and Data Science (B.Tech, CGPA 7.9)</strong> shapes my engineering mindset: I focus on clean data schemas, mathematical accuracy in cost accounting, and scalable business logic. I chose Odoo because it provides an integrated, modular framework that connects every core enterprise function—Sales, Purchase, Inventory, Manufacturing (MRP), Accounting, and POS.
        </p>

        <p>
          In my day-to-day work, I translate requirements gathered in client meetings into production code: writing Python ORM models, TransientModel wizards, XML views with XPath inheritance, custom OWL 2 frontend patches, and optimized PostgreSQL queries. I collaborate closely with implementation teams, maintaining high code quality through Git branching and containerized Docker Compose environments.
        </p>

        <p>
          I am actively available for <strong>immediate hire</strong> and open to global software engineering roles across India, the GCC, Europe, and remote opportunities.
        </p>

        <div class="about-quick-specs">
          <div class="spec-item">
            <span class="spec-label">Education</span>
            <span class="spec-val">B.Tech in Artificial Intelligence & Data Science</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-item">
            <span class="spec-label">Current Role</span>
            <span class="spec-val">Odoo Developer @ Prosevo Technologies</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-item">
            <span class="spec-label">Specialization</span>
            <span class="spec-val">Odoo 17 & 18, Python ORM, OWL 2, PostgreSQL</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-item">
            <span class="spec-label">Notice Period</span>
            <span class="spec-val highlight-val">Immediate Availability</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature Highlight Pillars -->
      <div class="about-pillars-col reveal-stagger">
        <div class="pillar-card">
          <div class="pillar-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="m18 16 4-4-4-4"></path>
              <path d="m6 8-4 4 4 4"></path>
              <path d="m14.5 4-5 16"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar-content">
            <h4>Backend & Odoo ORM Logic</h4>
            <p>Custom models, model inheritance, computed & related fields, SQL constraints, onchange validation, and TransientModel interactive wizards.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pillar-card">
          <div class="pillar-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"></rect>
              <path d="M3 9h18"></path>
              <path d="M9 21V9"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar-content">
            <h4>OWL 2 & Custom Web Views</h4>
            <p>Odoo Web Library 2 components, JavaScript patches, XML views (Form, Tree, Kanban, Pivot), and QWeb PDF/80mm thermal receipts.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pillar-card">
          <div class="pillar-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect width="16" height="20" x="4" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
              <path d="M9 22v-4h6v4"></path>
              <path d="M8 6h.01"></path>
              <path d="M16 6h.01"></path>
              <path d="M12 6h.01"></path>
              <path d="M12 10h.01"></path>
              <path d="M12 14h.01"></path>
              <path d="M16 10h.01"></path>
              <path d="M16 14h.01"></path>
              <path d="M8 10h.01"></path>
              <path d="M8 14h.01"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar-content">
            <h4>Multi-Company & Branch Architecture</h4>
            <p>Multi-branch isolation with record-rule-based security (<code>ir.rule</code>), automated user groups, and multi-journal financial setups.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pillar-card">
          <div class="pillar-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"></path>
              <polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"></polyline>
              <line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar-content">
            <h4>Docker Deployments & DevOps</h4>
            <p>Containerized Odoo 18 / PostgreSQL stacks, Git branching workflows (Dev → Quality → UAT), and automated ir.cron scheduled actions.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
    gap: 3.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-text-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .lead-text {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .lead-text strong {
    color: var(--accent-primary);
  }

  .lead-text em {
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .about-quick-specs {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .spec-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .spec-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .spec-val {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .highlight-val {
    color: #10b981;
  }

  /* Pillars Column */
  .about-pillars-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .pillar-card {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    background-color: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    transition: all var(--transition-normal);
  }

  .pillar-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
    transform: translateX(4px);
    background-color: var(--bg-card-hover);
  }

  .pillar-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 2.75rem;
    height: 2.75rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background-color: var(--accent-subtle);
    color: var(--accent-text);
  }

  .pillar-content h4 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .pillar-content p {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .pillar-content code {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.35rem;
    background: var(--code-bg);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }

    .about-quick-specs {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
